# A 4x2 grid of cells on paper, 48px pitch. Each boolean node is filled and has an ink outline of 2px.
# Top row, two overlapping circles (radius 14, centers 12px apart horizontally, left operand first), left to right:
# 1. `union` (red): one peanut-shaped blob covering both circles, with no line where they overlap.
# 2. `subtract` (blue): the left circle with the right circle bitten out, a crescent open to the right.
# 3. `intersect` (green): only the lens shape where the two circles overlap, narrow and pointed top and bottom.
# 4. `xor` (gold): both circles minus the lens, so two crescents with a gap of paper between them in the middle.
# Bottom row, left to right:
# 5. `subtract` of three operands (red): a 36x36 square with a circle (radius 8) bitten out of its left edge center and another of its right edge center, so two semicircular notches.
# 6. `union` of a wide rect (36x12) and a tall rect (12x36) (blue): a plus sign, one solid shape.
# 7. `subtract` using `copy @moon`: a gold crescent made by copying the blue circle's outline and subtracting a copy shifted up and left; the crescent is thick at the lower right and open toward the upper left. The blue circle (radius 16, named moon) is drawn first and shows where the crescent is absent, filling the upper-left part of the round shape.
# 8. `intersect` of a rect (36x36) and a 5-point star (radius 28) (green): a star whose five points are cut off flat where they pass the square's edges, so the top point, the two side points and the two lower points all end in short straight edges on the square's outline.
# KNOWN BUG #79: a shape child with no `at:` ignores its group's `at:` and renders at the artboard center; rect and star operands here write `at:0,0` to pin the place. When fixed, they would sit at the parent's origin without `at:0,0`.
@artboard 192x96
@target structure/booleans.png

union at:24,24 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,2
  circle 14 at:-6,0
  circle 14 at:6,0

subtract at:72,24 fill:p.blue stroke:p.ink,2
  circle 14 at:-6,0
  circle 14 at:6,0

intersect at:120,24 fill:p.green stroke:p.ink,2
  circle 14 at:-6,0
  circle 14 at:6,0

xor at:168,24 fill:p.gold stroke:p.ink,2
  circle 14 at:-6,0
  circle 14 at:6,0

subtract at:24,72 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,2
  rect 36x36 at:0,0
  circle 8 at:-18,0
  circle 8 at:18,0

union at:72,72 fill:p.blue stroke:p.ink,2
  rect 36x12 at:0,0
  rect 12x36 at:0,0

circle 16 at:120,72 fill:p.blue name:moon
subtract at:120,72 fill:p.gold stroke:p.ink,2
  copy @moon
  copy @moon at:-8,-6

intersect at:168,72 fill:p.green stroke:p.ink,2
  rect 36x36 at:0,0
  star 5 r:28 at:0,0
